  "scenario": {
    "title": "Asymmetric Disaggregation & Merger",
    "description": "Models a complex 'fracture'. Legacy Council A is primarily merging with Council B to form 'Unitary AB'. However, border boundary changes mean Council A must also carve off portions of its Adult Social Care and Highways services to neighbouring Unitary C and Unitary D. The engine highlights the immediate need for Service Level Agreements (SLAs) to support the fragmented authorities."
